  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "BIM室內設計實作",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICE OF BUILDING INFORMATION MODELING IN INTERIOR DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以 BIM 管理及技術傳授為目地，BIM 是以高維度的建築資訊視覺化模型在建築全生命週期中輔助各專業完成成果交付及管理任務。 建築全生命週期中的參與方及階段分別為業主、設計、承包商、營運管理機構;開發啟始、設計、營建、移交、維護更新。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is BIM management and technology transfer. BIM is a high-dimensional building information visualization model that assists various majors in completing the delivery and management tasks of the results during the entire life cycle of the building. Participants and stages in the whole life cycle of a building are the owner, design, contractor, and operation management organization; development initiation, design, construction, handover, maintenance and renewal.",
